<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/heroes/hero-crm.jpg');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Customer relationship management</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Professional Sales & Customer Lifecycle Infrastructure.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            A centralized system for managing the complete customer journey—from initial lead capture to 
            long-term loyalty—providing your sales and service teams with the tools and data needed to 
            drive revenue and customer satisfaction.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            The CRM system comprises integrated components that work together to provide complete 
            customer relationship management. Each component addresses specific stages of the 
            customer lifecycle while contributing to unified intelligence and reporting.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Real-time sales performance and customer engagement visibility with pipeline health, 
                    conversion metrics, activity tracking, and executive KPIs for informed decision-making.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/leads">Leads</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Capture, qualify, and assign inquiries from web, WhatsApp, and phone. Automated scoring 
                    and assignment rules ensure rapid first-contact response and structured prospect grooming.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/opportunities">Opportunities</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Manage active deals through structured sales stages with activity timelines, probability 
                    weighting, and competitor tracking to maximize win rates and project accuracy.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/pipeline">Pipeline</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Visual kanban and list views of the entire sales funnel. Monitor deal velocity, identify 
                    bottlenecks, and manage stage-specific workflows to drive consistent revenue conversion.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/accounts">Accounts</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Comprehensive company profiles with parent-child hierarchies, transaction history, 
                    document libraries, and relationship analytics for B2B relationship management.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/contacts">Contacts</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Individual stakeholder profiles with communication preferences, interaction timelines, 
                    and social profile integration for personalized, multi-channel engagement.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/customers">Customers</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Unified view of onboarded clients, tracking lifetime value (LV), churn risk, and service 
                    history to drive retention and cross-sell opportunities within the install base.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/activities">Activities</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Seamless logging and scheduling of calls, meetings, emails, and WhatsApp messages. 
                    Manage tasks and calendars with team visibility and automated follow-up reminders.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/cases">Cases</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Structured helpdesk and ticket management system for post-sale support. Track SLAs, 
                    response times, and resolution paths via multi-channel ticket intake (Email, Web, WhatsApp).
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/inbox">Inbox</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Integrated communication hub for sales reps, consolidating email and WhatsApp threads 
                    directly within the CRM context for rapid and persistent messaging.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/campaigns">Campaigns</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Omni-channel marketing automation with campaign ROI tracking, email/SMS drip sequences, 
                    and list segmentation for targeted demand generation and prospect nurturing.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/cadences">Cadences</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Structured sales playbooks and sequence automations for outbound prospecting. Define 
                    multi-day, multi-channel touchpoint workflows for sales development teams.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/forecasts">Forecasts</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Revenue projection tools based on weighted pipeline and historical win rates. Track quota 
                    attainment and analyze period-over-period revenue trajectories for financial planning.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/quotes">Quotes</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Professional quotation and proposal generation with multi-currency support (USD/ZiG), 
                    e-signature integration, and seamless conversion from CRM deal to ERP sales order.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/knowledge">Knowledge</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Internal and customer-facing FAQ and article library. Empower service teams with solutions 
                    and enable customer self-service for common queries and product documentation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/pipelinestages">Pipeline Stages</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Configurable sales funnel steps tailored to your organizational process. Define entry and 
                    exit criteria for each stage to ensure pipeline data integrity and sales discipline.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/leadsources">Lead Sources</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Attribution tracking for demand generation. Analyze which marketing channels (Web, 
                    Referral, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) produce the highest quality leads and revenue.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/crm/reports">Reports</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Comprehensive reporting suite with custom builders. Generate automated reports on sales rep 
                    productivity, campaign performance, and complex customer relationship analytics.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Lead-to-Loyalty Management</h2>
        <p>
            Pindah CRM provides the structural foundation for your entire sales and marketing operation. 
            From the moment an enquiry arrives via WhatsApp or a web form, the system ensures it is 
            qualified and assigned correctly. Lead scoring models identify high-priority prospects, 
            allowing your sales team to focus their energy on the deals most likely to close.
        </p>
        <p>
            The transition from lead to opportunity is seamless, maintaining a complete history of engagement 
            throughout the cycle. Marketing automation tools nurture leads with personalized drip 
            sequences, ensuring your brand remains top-of-mind until the prospect is ready to purchase.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">360-Degree Relationship Visibility</h2>
        <p>
            B2B relationships are complex, often involving multiple stakeholders across various departments. 
            Our account and contact management modules provide a unified source of truth for every 
            interaction. View meetings held, emails sent, documents shared, and quotes issued in one 
            centralized timeline.
        </p>
        <p>
            Parent-child account hierarchies accommodate complex corporate structures, giving you visibility 
            into grouping relationships (e.g., a head office and its regional branches). This intelligence 
            is essential for strategic account planning and maximizing enterprise-wide value.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Actionable Sales Intelligence</h2>
        <p>
            Move beyond intuition with data-driven sales forecasting and analytics. Revenue forecasts utilize 
            weighted pipeline calculations to provide a realistic view of future financial performance. 
            Detailed reports on sales velocity—the time it takes a deal to move from prospecting to 
            closed—identify performance gaps and coaching opportunities.
        </p>
        <p>
            Conversion rate analysis across stages and lead sources identifies your most effective marketing 
            channels, allowing for precise budget allocation and campaign optimization.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Premium Service and Helpdesk Integration</h2>
        <p>
            The customer relationship continues long after the sale. Integrated helpdesk and case management 
            ensure that customer issues are addressed with professional discipline. Multichannel ticket 
            ingestion (Email, WhatsApp, Web) ensures accessibility, while SLA tracking ensures 
            responsiveness.
        </p>
        <p>
            A centralized knowledge base empowers your service team with consistent solutions and 
            provides customers with self-service options, reducing ticket volumes and improving 
            satisfaction scores.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
